[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4081.67, "timestamp": "01:08:01", "text": "暗視能力を持つ。両チームとも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4083.27, "timestamp": "01:08:03", "text": "暗視能力を持たないキャラクター。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4085.99, "timestamp": "01:08:05", "text": "それなら、それも役に立つでしょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4088.71, "timestamp": "01:08:08", "text": "いや、そうじゃないよ。わかった。わかった。ああ、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4091.67, "timestamp": "01:08:11", "text": "ああ、あなたは暗い場所にいて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4092.63, "timestamp": "01:08:12", "text": "もの。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4094.47, "timestamp": "01:08:14", "text": "うん。うん。次のようなものがあります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4095.91, "timestamp": "01:08:15", "text": "見えない場所とか、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4097.51, "timestamp": "01:08:17", "text": "それ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4097.99, "timestamp": "01:08:17", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4099.749, "timestamp": "01:08:19", "text": "あなたには暗視能力があります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4103.189, "timestamp": "01:08:23", "text": "基本的には暗視装置です。ああ、でも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4106.229, "timestamp": "01:08:26", "text": "暗闇の中では、暗闇の中では、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4107.99, "timestamp": "01:08:27", "text": "もう一度、ぼんやりと物を見ている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4111.91, "timestamp": "01:08:31", "text": "光は不利な要素である。だから、それをそのままにしておいてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4114.709, "timestamp": "01:08:34", "text": "心に留めて。まあ、そうですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4117.749, "timestamp": "01:08:37", "text": "わかった。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4120.149, "timestamp": "01:08:40", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4122.789, "timestamp": "01:08:42", "text": "それなら、明るい色にしようと思います。ただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4124.789, "timestamp": "01:08:44", "text": "試す。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4127.51, "timestamp": "01:08:47", "text": "わかった。能力スコアについては、ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4128.789, "timestamp": "01:08:48", "text": "まあ、知恵を選ぶだけだと思う​​。"}, {"type": "